        <mxCell id="XDFivQQymPn6_W2-JGWK-56" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;Supporting Facts&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="430" x="-620" y="745" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XDFivQQymPn6_W2-JGWK-64" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Officers possessed the correct warrant information but failed to verify the residence&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Hartsfield v. Lemacks&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&quot;Newton had the warrant in his possession, he did not check to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;make sure that he was leading the other officers to the correct address,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;let alone perform any precautionary measures such as those performed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;by the officers in Garrison. . . . the district court erred in holding that he w&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;as protected by qualified immunity&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;Hartsfield v. Lemacks, 50 F.3d 950, 955 (11th Cir. 1995), as amended (June 14, 1995)&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="470" x="-1570" y="1250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="DD2WaZDuvtyOgiMceYJj" name="MY">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1703" dy="950" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-1" edge="1" parent="1" source="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-3" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-20" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-2" edge="1" parent="1" source="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-3" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-24" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-3" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;Fifth Amendment Inverse Condemnation&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;The Claim: The SWAT team&#39;s physical destruction of the Nguyens&#39; home ($112,678 in damages) to execute a warrant was a public &quot;taking&quot; of private property for public use, requiring &quot;just compensation&quot; under the Fifth Amendment [JA 3]. The Defense: Tactical law enforcement damage is a non-compensable exercise of the state&#39;s emergency Police Power (or necessity), which operates as an exception to the Takings Clause [JA 9, 26, 32].&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="430" x="620" y="340" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-4" edge="1" parent="1" source="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-6" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-29" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-5" edge="1" parent="1" source="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-6" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-32" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-6" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Municipal Liability &amp;amp; Section 1983 Policy/Custom&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;The Claim: Mission City is liable under § 1983 because its City Council—the final policymaking body—voted to deny the Nguyens just compensation, thereby officially executing the municipal policy that completed the Fifth Amendment violation [JA 3–4, 28]. The Defense: There was no municipal policy to raid the wrong home, and the City cannot be held liable under a vicarious liability (respondeat superior) theory [JA 28, 32].&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="430" x="1530" y="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-7" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;Right of action for inverse condemnation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Knick v. Township of Scott (2019)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="300" x="680" y="850" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-8" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;per se physical taking&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Cedar Point Nursery v. Hassid (2021)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="330" x="280" y="1035" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-9" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;Pursue Fifth Amendment remedies&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Devillier v. Texas (2024&lt;/i&gt;)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="270" x="520" y="950" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-10" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;SWAT damage does not constitute a compensable taking under the Fifth Amendment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Baker v. City of McKinney (5th Cir. 2023)&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="340" x="820" y="935" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-11" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;municipalities can be sued under § 1983, but only when the constitutional injury was caused by an official policy, custom, or practice.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Monell v. Department of Social Services (1978)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="320" x="1610" y="820" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-12" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Single decision by a municipal official&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Pembaur v. City of Cincinnati (1986)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="280" x="1320" y="890" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-13" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Municipalities do not possess qualified immunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Owen v. City of Independence (1980)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="320" x="1300" y="1005" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-14" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;State and local law dictate whether an official possesses final policymaking authority&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;St. Louis v. Praprotnik (1988)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="290" x="1640" y="955" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-15" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&quot;deliberate indifference&quot; standard for establishing municipal liability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Board of County Commissioners of Bryan County v. Brown (1997)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="320" x="1950" y="880" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="N42kKp3f802c-h-2Ez8b-16" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Failure to train police officers can serve as a municipal policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;City of Canton v. Harris (1989)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="340" x="1060" y="1130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
